WEBVTT

01:30.700 --> 01:33.060
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

01:33.060 --> 01:34.700
(Diadaptasi daripada
novel bertajuk sama karya Yiren Kuikui)

01:35.100 --> 01:38.900
=Episod 3=

01:59.550 --> 02:00.030
Puteri,

02:01.060 --> 02:01.670
awak tak apa-apa?

02:02.470 --> 02:03.190
Adakah awak cedera di mana-mana?

02:08.020 --> 02:09.140
