18:22.470 --> 18:23.020
Ya, saya kurang ajar.

18:29.260 --> 18:29.990
Jangan harap awak boleh pergi.

18:39.230 --> 18:39.670
Saya tak pergi.

18:43.150 --> 18:43.580
Abang,

18:44.100 --> 18:45.150
