18:52.230 --> 18:53.150
mungkin masih cari saya.

18:54.150 --> 18:55.300
Tolong beritahu mereka.

18:56.020 --> 18:56.340
Baiklah.

19:33.710 --> 19:34.630
Hamba memang patut dihukum.

19:34.710 --> 19:36.060
Hamba gagal melindungi cik muda.

19:36.580 --> 19:37.390
Hamba ingat...

19:38.100 --> 19:38.740
Ingat...

19:38.870 --> 19:39.670
Ingat

19:40.060 --> 19:41.390
