20:20.230 --> 20:21.300
Sekurang-kurangnya lap badan sikit.

20:21.870 --> 20:22.710
Pergi jerang air.

20:28.710 --> 20:30.470
Cik muda...

20:30.780 --> 20:32.540
Malangnya nasib cik muda...

20:33.260 --> 20:35.230
Cik muda...

20:37.230 --> 20:39.100
Cik muda...

20:39.580 --> 20:41.500
Malangnya nasib cik muda...

